# The style this library is already written in: Google, two-space indent, an
# 80 column limit. It is declared here rather than assumed so the lint gate has
# an agreed style to check a changed file against.
#
# Only the code this repository owns is checked against it. The vendored trees
# come with their own formatting and are excluded in
# .github/ci-gates/ci-gates.conf.
BasedOnStyle: Google
